2. Initialized i18next with basic configuration
3. Wrapped the UserForm component with `I18nextProvider`

This should resolve the `require is not defined` error by properly setting up the i18n context that the component needs. The error was occurring because the component was trying to use i18n functionality without the proper provider and configuration in place.

